o knowledge, and I invite you to the Exalted in Might, the Perpetual Forgiver.","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"40:43","t":"Assuredly, that to which you invite me has no [response to a] supplication in this world or in the Hereafter; and indeed, our return is to Allāh, and indeed, the transgressors will be companions of the Fire.","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"40:44","t":"And you will remember what I [now] say to you, and I entrust my affair to Allāh. Indeed, Allāh is Seeing of [His] servants.\"","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"40:45","t":"So Allāh protected him from the evils they plotted, and the people of Pharaoh were enveloped by the worst of punishment -","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"40:46","t":"The Fire; they are exposed to it morning and evening. And the Day the Hour appears [it will be said], \"Make the people of Pharaoh enter the severest punishment.\"","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"40:47","t":"And [mention] when they will argue within the Fire, and the weak will say to those who had been arrogant, \"Indeed, we were [only] your followers, so will you relieve us of a share of the Fire?\"","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"40:48","t":"Those who had been arrogant will say, \"Indeed, all [of us] are in it. Indeed, Allāh has judged between the servants.\"","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"40:49","t":"And those in the Fire will say to the keepers of Hell, \"Supplicate your Lord to lighten for us a day from the punishment.\"","j":24,"h":48,"s":40,"a":49,"sd":null}],"juz":24,"hizb":48,"surahs":[40],"sajdah":false}